SUMMARY:Wine Country Bingo
DESCRIPTION:Located in the Lodge Room at the Santa Rosa Veterans Memorial Building\, Wine Country Bingo will bring a fun evening of games\, community and excitement every 2nd Thursday of the month. \nCelebrate Wine Country Trykes 1 Year Anniversary with Early Bird\, 7 Pack Games\, Flash and Pull Tabs \nFood\, Snacks & Beverages. 18+ only. \nLIMITED SEATING! DOORS OPEN AT 5 PM. GAMES START AT 6 PM \nADMISSION $35:(1) ONE Adult Admission Seat.(2) TWO 6 Game Board Packs (12 Cards per game). Total of 7 Pack Games + 1 Dauber \nExtra Packs available at the door.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/wine-country-bingo-4/
LOCATION:Santa Rosa Veterans Memorial Building\, 1351 Maple Ave\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
