SUMMARY:Sips and Stars
DESCRIPTION:“An evening of fine wine and cosmic wonder! As twilight falls\, relax with a glass of wine in hand and listen to engaging astronomy talks from our knowledgeable docents. Once darkness settles\, step up to the observatory’s telescopes for guided viewing of planets\, star clusters\, and distant galaxies.\nWhether you’re a wine lover\, stargazer\, or simply looking for a unique evening out in Sonoma Valley\, Sips & Stars promises an unforgettable experience where earthly pleasures meet celestial beauty.\nWine courtesy of Landmark Vineyards\, known for their exceptional Chardonnay and Pinot Noir. Guests must be 21 or older to attend and each registration includes two drink tickets. Proceeds support the Robert Ferguson Observatory’s public education programs.\n“
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/sips-and-stars/
LOCATION:Robert Ferguson Observatory\, 2605 Adobe Canyon Road\, Kenwood\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
END:VEVENT
