SUMMARY:Candlelight: 90s Unplugged
DESCRIPTION:⭐ Candlelight concerts bring the magic of a live\, multi-sensory musical experience to awe-inspiring locations like never seen before in Sonoma County. Get your tickets now to discover the music of 90s Unplugged at Sebastiani Theatre under the gentle glow of candlelight. \nThis is a tribute concert experience. It is not affiliated with\, endorsed by\, or sponsored by the artist\, their estate\, or official representatives.\nGeneral Info\n📍 Venue: Sebastiani Theatre\n📅 Dates and times: select your dates/times directly in the ticket selector\n⏳ Duration: 60 minutes. Doors open 45 minutes before the show. No entry once it starts.\n👤 Age requirement: 8 years old or older. Anyone under the age of 16 must be accompanied by an adult\n♿ Accessibility: this venue is ADA compliant \n  \nTentative Program \nEverlong – Foo Fighters\nDon’t Speak – No Doubt\nZombie – The Cranberries\nIronic – Alanis Morrissette\nWonderwall – Oasis\nHigh and Dry – Radiohead\nEnter Sandman – Metallica\nUnder the Bridge – Red Hot Chili Peppers\nFly Away – Lenny Kravitz\nHallelujah – Jeff Buckley\nTears in Heaven – Eric Clapton\nSmells Like Teen Spirit – Nirvana \nPerformers \nString Quartet – Listeso – Sonoma County
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/candlelight-90s-unplugged-2/
LOCATION:Sebastiani Theatre\, 476 First Street East\, Sonoma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
END:VEVENT
