SUMMARY:Bored Teachers "Is it Friday Yet?!" Comedy Tour 2026
DESCRIPTION:They’ve graded the papers\, survived the staff meetings\, and lost their last ounce of patience…and now they’re taking it out on stage! Bored Teachers is back with brand-new jokes\, bigger laughs\, and the most relatable teacher comedy you’ll ever hear. For nearly a decade\, Bored Teachers has been the number one voice of teacher humor\, racking up more than one billion views\, amassing 10 million+ followers\, and hosting the number one teacher-comedy podcast on the planet.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/bored-teachers-is-it-friday-yet-comedy-tour-2026/
LOCATION:Luther Burbank Center for the Arts\, 50 Mark West Springs Road\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Comedy
